{"type":"exercise","type_name":"Exercise","number":"","title":"A1","title_html":"A1","html":"<p>Let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A},\\mathbf{B}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be idempotent of the\nsame size. Show that <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{B}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is\nidempotent if <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{B}=\\mathbf{B}\\mathbf{A}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and that\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}+\\mathbf{B}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is idempotent iff <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{B}+\\mathbf{B}\\mathbf{A}=\\mathbf{0}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Show that the latter\nforces <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{B}=\\mathbf{0}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D401 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> (symmetry is not\nneeded).</p>","file":"ch01-matrix-algebra/09-idempotent.html"}